What happens if the cache is distributed across multiple servers?


Local LRU
Server 1
   |
HashMap + DLL

Easy: one global lock protects both.

Distributed Cache
                Application
                     |
             Consistent Hashing
             /        |        \
            ↓         ↓         ↓
        Server 1   Server 2   Server 3
        Map + DLL  Map + DLL  Map + DLL

Each server has its own independent LRU cache.
Each server manages its own eviction independently.


